eated_at": "2021-08-31T18:17:01Z", "repo": "wish", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ce79f2d93f56aacaf032ef024d0f1afaff8a3751", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2021-08-31T17:45:01Z", "repo": "wish", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "690ddfc6efd14640896a45ac812348cfd882651b", "message": "code for rolls and data for characters and weapons", "created_at": "2021-08-31T17:42:14Z", "repo": "wish", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39c2508ad01d01ed2851daa1dd13a115324b1022", "message": "[Fix]: Missing main.py edits", "created_at": "2025-01-19T00:16:08Z", "repo": "run-planner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e29e93f21106cae5a6dd67a30e7464e4692edf91", "message": "[Feature]: Workout \n\n* refactor frontend by breaking up app in App.tsx into smaller components\r\n* refactor backend by moving non-business logic code into \"core\" directory\r\n* add CRUD endpoints for creating/listing/deleting workouts to backend\r\n* install alembic and use postgresql for database\r\n* update compose.yml with database for local development", "created_at": "2025-01-18T01:35:41Z", "repo": "run-planner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d1a27cfd913aa8d6b9e3ba1f47c58eac95aa213a", "message": "[Feature]: Vdot \n\n* show vdot score when calculating pace\r\n* endpoint to get training paces based on vdot\r\n* add 800 and 1600 meter race distances", "created_at": "2025-01-15T03:49:29Z", "repo": "run-planner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "93de185e382acbb910dafc4cfd0ea54a5bae2ba0", "message": "refactor calcs.py with datetime package\n\nuse datetime package to simplify calcs.py dealing with paces\r\n* update parameters in most methods to use timedelta \r\n* use datetime.strptime for parsing strings", "created_at": "2025-01-13T04:50:21Z", "repo": "run-planner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "32fec6f6a1c5bc0052a4713a4daaf8c4ec88d2d1", "message": "move app bar to the top and combine calculator + paces \n\n<img width=\"1278\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-01-12 at 5 47 13 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d6e5692-fe7c-4fdc-8035-0b6c8a80c8f9\" />", "created_at": "2025-01-13T01:47:52Z", "repo": "run-planner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0027ed99c1a0e3072f474b144df3f7f3127b3f95", "message": "[Feature] Workout endpoint \n\n* add endpoint for building workouts\r\n* simplify workout model", "created_at": "2025-01-12T21:24:50Z", "repo": "run-planner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2ac1a99febc979d299000cc46b1641cddacbf15d", "message": "[Feature]: Add race percentages table to calculator", "created_at": "2025-01-08T06:53:43Z", "repo": "run-planner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8c4a6ea5f879a3eb010b4ca29f759fa63e9edb8b", "message": "[Feature]: Pace Calculator Widget\n\nAdded create-react-app TypeScript files in frontend/ and FastAPI python files in backend/.  Added unit tests for calcs.py. Created Dockerfiles for both directories and a compose.yml in the root directory for local development. Backend uses python3.13 with FastAPI dependencies installed. Frontend uses React v19, Axios for calling the FastAPI endpoints, material UI for component libraries, and TypeScript. Updated github action to run python unit tests.", "created_at": "2025-01-04T07:17:27Z", "repo": "run-planner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "864266209778536caca344a91942ee1d1d406d30", "message": "Create python-app.yml", "created_at": "2024-03-04T23:09:58Z", "repo": "run-planner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0addf621b134bf7ea568c